  "recipeOutline": "",
  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nI created this recipe with my preferences fully expressed, under the theme of \"a recipe for calm and gentle colors like the Sea of Setouchi*.\" It provides a pale and slightly nostalgic atmosphere, so it is better suited for photos with fewer colors than colorful ones. As the \"Setouchi Blue\" in the title suggests, I would be happy if you enjoy using it with blue colors, such as the sky and the sea. Slightly increasing the exposure during shooting will bring out even richer and more nuanced colors.\n\n*Japan's largest inland sea, located in western Japan. This enclosed sea is blessed with nature and a mild climate.",
